      <text><![CDATA[<p>Factorise&nbsp;</p><p>\( x^2 \)&nbsp;\( + \) \({@cc@}\)\( x \) \( - \) \({@-dd@}\)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]<br></p><p><br></p><p>Simplify&nbsp;\( (3n^{@cc+1@}w^{@cc@})^2 \)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br></p>

<p>(You may use the ^ button to write powers)</p><p>[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt2]]<br></p><br><p></p><p></p><p>Express as a single simplified fraction.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>(You should put brackets around the numerator and brackets around the denominator).</p><p>\( \displaystyle \frac{{@ff@}}{x+1} + \frac{{@gg@}}{2x}  \)<br></p><p>[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]]&nbsp;[[feedback:prt3]]<br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>]]></text>
